  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support our Children with Cancer on Giving Tuesday</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hatice was one of our registered patients and had met with leukemia 10 years ago. She overcame the disease after 3 years of treatment with the support of LOSEV. She has been working in LOSEV administrative affairs since 2 years and now supporting other children with leukemia in their fight against the disease. Thanks to your donations to LOSEV. Thousands of children like Hatice are getting better and holding on to life with your donations.</narrative>
  </description>
